      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Material fraud event; mandatory report; law-enforcement referral
Frequency: Per material event + periodic reporting
Volume: ~20–100 material events/yr requiring external coordination
Owner: Fraud Management / Legal
Participants: Fraud Management, Legal (links to VS-100), Compliance (links to VS-22), Privacy/DPO (links to VS-91), AML (links to VS-86), Finance (links to VS-17), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), Corporate Affairs (links to VS-14.3/VS-104)
Source: workflow W3877 — Fraud Reporting, Regulatory &amp; Law-Enforcement Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
