      <bpmn:userTask id="W3877_Task4" name="Fraud Management/Legal/Compliance assess reportability: AML/STR to AMLC where…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Fraud Management/Legal/Compliance assess reportability: AML/STR to AMLC where predicate offense (links to VS-86), data-breach to NPC under RA 10173 if applicable (links to VS-91), insurance notice (links to VS-26), audit committee disclosure (links to VS-21/VS-36), and securities/board disclosure for material loss
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): CFO / VP Legal
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3877_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3877_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3877_Task5" name="Fraud Management/Legal coordinate law-enforcement referral…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Fraud Management/Legal coordinate law-enforcement referral (PNP-CIDG/NBI/Cybercrime for organized/ecommerce/ATO), provide evidence packs (links to W3873), and track cases through prosecution (links to VS-100 matter management)
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3877_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3877_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3877_Task6" name="Fraud Management/Corporate-Affairs manage external communications on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Fraud Management/Corporate-Affairs manage external communications on material/visible fraud events (links to VS-14.3) and protect brand/reputation (links to VS-100/W1562), with privacy-by-design in any disclosure
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Corporate Affairs / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CMO
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3877_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3877_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
