      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Training cycle; new-scheme alert; onboarding
Frequency: Annual + onboarding + on alert
Volume: ~6,911 employees + ~10–20% contingent; ~5,800 store staff focus
Owner: Fraud Management / L&amp;D
Participants: Fraud Management, L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4/VS-124), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Customer Service (links to VS-13/VS-32), HR (links to VS-19), Sales Enablement (links to VS-124)
Source: workflow W3879 — Fraud Awareness Training &amp; Store/Agent Enablement</bpmn:documentation>
