        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Fraud Management/L&amp;D develop role-specific fraud-awareness training: cashiers (override/refund/returns fraud), customer-service (return/refund abuse), ecommerce ops (chargeback/ATO), trade sales (application/BEC), buyers (procurement fraud links to VS-86.3), and managers (investigation escalation)
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
