        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Fraud Management/Store-Ops deliver training via LMS (links to VS-19.4), micro-learning and huddle alerts (links to VS-63 store comms / VS-124 enablement), and brief on emerging schemes (links to W3858)
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / L&amp;D / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3879_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3879_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3879_Task6" name="Fraud Management measure awareness effectiveness (incident-rate by store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Fraud Management measure awareness effectiveness (incident-rate by store, training completion, mystery-shop on refund/override compliance) and reinforce high-risk stores (links to VS-23/W3850)
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Insights / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3879_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3879_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
